sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Coach as Coach Web
  participant API as Server API
  participant Store as Store
  participant MQTT as MQTT Gateway
  participant EMQX as EMQX Broker
  participant TV1 as TV Screen 1
  participant TV3 as TV Screen 3
  participant TV5 as TV Screen 5

  Coach->>API: POST /api/tv/playback-sessions/preview
  API->>API: 校验账号与场馆权限
  API->>Store: 创建 PREVIEW session
  Store-->>API: sessionId + accountNamespace
  API->>MQTT: publish session_updated
  API->>MQTT: publish preview_course
  MQTT->>EMQX: infini/tv/session/{namespace}
  MQTT->>EMQX: infini/tv/control/{namespace}
  EMQX-->>TV1: preview_course
  EMQX-->>TV3: preview_course
  EMQX-->>TV5: preview_course
  TV1->>API: GET current session / daily bundle if needed
  TV3->>API: GET current session / daily bundle if needed
  TV5->>API: GET current session / daily bundle if needed
  TV1-->>TV1: 显示预览，不开始计时
  TV3-->>TV3: 显示预览，不开始计时
  TV5-->>TV5: 显示预览，不开始计时

  Coach->>API: POST /api/tv/playback-sessions/{id}/start
  API->>Store: 写入 SCHEDULED/RUNNING + playbackStartAtMs
  Store-->>API: authoritative session
  API->>MQTT: publish session_updated + start_course
  MQTT->>EMQX: publish to namespace
  EMQX-->>TV1: start_course
  EMQX-->>TV3: start_course
  EMQX-->>TV5: start_course
  TV1->>API: 拉取权威 session
  TV3->>API: 拉取权威 session
  TV5->>API: 拉取权威 session
  TV1-->>TV1: 等待 playbackStartAtMs
  TV3-->>TV3: 等待 playbackStartAtMs
  TV5-->>TV5: 等待 playbackStartAtMs
  TV1-->>TV1: 按 serverStartAtMs 计算 offset
  TV3-->>TV3: 按 serverStartAtMs 计算 offset
  TV5-->>TV5: 按 serverStartAtMs 计算 offset

